  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Catalytic fund with provision of demand led technical assistance and research</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Catalytic Fund aims to demonstrate and upscale new innovative solutions to old challenges in the management of water as a resource. It will seek government buy-in to these. The fund will also cover the provision of research, analysis and evaluation to ensure the sustainability of the interventions. OPM Ltd is the supplier for this component.</narrative>
  </description>
